Experiment 5: Basic Data Visualization using Matplotlib Program: 
import pandas as pd import matplotlib.pyplot as plt data = pd.read_csv("daily_sales_2025_v2.csv") 
data["Date"] = pd.to_datetime(data["Date"]) print("First Five Records:") print(data.head()) 
